    <l n="15">glis, a webb; &amp; to weave.</l>
    <l n="16" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Φ</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">Φλάω, ἀπάλλω, decipio. Notum satis</l>
    <l n="18">&amp; usitatum verbum: An hinc</l>
    <l n="19">φιλήτης, fur, latro, &amp;c. fit, ob diversam scri-</l>
